			"notes": "New version includes great features!\n\n## Added Features\n- Smart Protection: Prevents wrong hits, item verification, double hit prevention.\n- Speed Mode: Blazing Fast mode (1-5x multiplier).\n- Fast mode is not working right now, please use normal mode.\n\n## Fixes\n- Dupe Counter: Correct counting with dropped item tracking.\n- Performance: Removed List.copyOf(), iterator optimization.\n- Inventory: Hotbar priority search, offhand optimization.\n- Multitask: Hitting and placing at the same time.\n- Delay System: Separate tracking for interaction and hit delays.\n- Always use Fabric Loader 0.18.X.\n- Version: 1.21.1 & 1.21.4\n\nThe release may still have bugs, feel free to report them."
		},
