			"notes": "- The item disappearing problem is fixed on 2.0.0 with optimizations and fixes.\n- Counter works now.\n- Added Offhand support. Works perfectly.\n- Fixed default selections (Diamond, Netherite, Emerald etc.) to Shulkers (Red, Green, White etc.).\n- Added chronometer.\n- Dupe counter toggle added.\n- Dupe counter display added. (ActionBar / Chat)\n- Increased Max Placements, Max Swaps and Max Inventory Moves from 64 to 128.\n- Min Stack Size increased from 10 to 64.\n- Added lyntaxqq to authors on fabric.mod.json. It shows up in home in Minecraft.\n- Fast mode is not working right now, please use normal mode.\n- Use Fabric Loader 0.18.X on 1.21.1 & 1.21.4 \nThe release is maybe still have bugs, feel free to report it.\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/lyntaxqq/KatanaDupe/compare/v...v2.0.0"
